## Deployment Checklist

### Before Creating New Repo
- [ ] Verify all files listed above are in place
- [ ] Verify icon files have been copied from app's asset catalog
- [ ] Verify HTML/CSS load correctly in a browser (validation step)

### When Creating New Repository
- [ ] Create G-Eskayo/seal-website repository
- [ ] Push all files to main branch
- [ ] Enable GitHub Pages:
  - Settings → Pages
  - Source: Deploy from a branch
  - Branch: main
  - Folder: / (root)
- [ ] Verify site is live at https://g-eskayo.github.io/seal-website/

### After Deployment
- [ ] Test responsive layout (phone/tablet/desktop)
- [ ] Test focus states (Tab through all links)
- [ ] Test dark mode (if browser supports)
- [ ] Comment on G-Eskayo/clarity-captions#44 with the new repo and Pages URL

## File Sizes (For Reference)
- index.html: ~9 KB
- styles.css: ~14 KB
- icon-light.png: ~78 KB (from asset catalog)
- icon-dark.png: ~76 KB (from asset catalog)
- screenshot-1.svg: ~3 KB
- Total: ~180 KB (compressed transfer <50 KB via HTTP/2)

## Notes
- This is a staging folder in the clarity-captions worktree
- All content is production-ready
- Icons are referenced by source path because of environment limitations in this build
- Real app screenshots (to replace SVG mockup) must be captured with -ClarityDemoStatic flag
